# Data licensing and redistribution

Code in this repository is MIT licensed. Data is not. This file records, per
source, what may be redistributed and under which terms. `data/MANIFEST.json`
carries the same flag per retrieved file, and the pre-release audit checks the
two against each other before anything is deposited.

Derived aggregates produced by this project are released under CC-BY-4.0 where
the upstream terms permit it. Where they do not, the release carries the code
that produces the aggregate and not the aggregate itself.

| Source | Terms | Redistribution |
|---|---|---|
| Open Targets Platform 26.06 | CC0-1.0 | Permitted with attribution |
| Orphanet and Orphadata | Orphanet terms of use | Attribution required. Inputs are not mirrored; derived onset tiers are released with attribution |
| Human Phenotype Ontology | HPO licence | Permitted with attribution |
| Mondo Disease Ontology | CC-BY-4.0 | Permitted with attribution |
| gnomAD v2.1.1 and v4.1 constraint | Free use with attribution | Permitted |
| GeneBayes s_het (Zenodo 10.5281/zenodo.10403680) | CC-BY-4.0 | Permitted with attribution |
| UCSC conservation tracks | UCSC Genome Browser terms | Inputs not redistributed. Per-gene aggregates are released |
| GENCODE | Free with attribution | Permitted |
| GTEx, DepMap | Respective portal terms | Per-gene aggregates only |
| Citeline Pharmaprojects, reached through the Minikel genetic support release | Proprietary | Nothing beyond what the upstream derived release already contains |
| FinnGen and Risteys | Confirm before deposit | Held pending written confirmation of terms for median-age and cumulative-incidence tables |
| Kuan et al. 2019 supplement | Journal supplement terms | Not redistributed |
| Human Mortality Database | Registration required | Not redistributed. Derived life-table summaries only |
| UN World Population Prospects | CC-BY-3.0-IGO | Permitted with attribution |
| Forager demography, Gurven and Kaplan 2007 | Journal terms | Transcribed schedules cited, not redistributed |
| UMLS Metathesaurus | Licence required | The API key is a secret and never enters the repository. Mapping outputs are released where the licence permits; the Metathesaurus is not |
| Evo 2 model weights | Model licence | Weights are not redistributed. Per-gene scores computed by this project are released with the model licence stated in the deposit README |

## Secrets

No credential belongs in this repository. The UMLS key and any API tokens are
read from the environment and injected in continuous integration through
repository secrets. A pre-commit hook scans staged content for key-shaped
strings.
